gentle questions such as ―What are you seeing?‖ or ―How does that make you feel?‖ Having an 
open discussion with the family while describing what is occurring may provide further insight to 
the nurse as the health care provider, as well as promoting a sense of understanding and  
acceptance for the family. As long as the patient is calm and content, the best action of the nurse is 
