b. ―I will contact the provider to obtain an order to insert the tube and start tube 
feedings.‖ 
c. ―Intravenous fluids would be more comfortable for the patient than a tube feeding. 
I will call the doctor to get the order.‖ 
d. ―I will listen to the patient‘s abdomen to make sure that bowel sounds are present and 
